      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62df3a55f6fa434679f836fa|full_name} You could use something like `OnWillRenderObject`, however, since we can't check the camera currently rendering the scene (`Camera.current` is not exposed) this is prone to misfires from other cameras in the world or from the player like a VRC Mirror or VRC Camera.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
